    "title": "GATEWAY-batchinsertion-Create Telecom Sim Portability-v1-spec",
    "description": "The Telecom Sim Portability API enables the batch insertion of telecom SIM card portability requests. This service is designed for telecom providers and associated systems to handle multiple portability requests efficiently. Users can submit a batch of portability requests, streamlining the process of transferring SIM cards between different service providers. Ideal for operations aiming to enhance customer experience during service transitions, this API facilitates quick and reliable processing of requests in bulk.",
